  "plain": "John Herrington, who served as US Secretary of Energy in President Reagan's cabinet in the 1980s, tells a podcast host, Jesse Michels, that the subject of UFOs never came up in his time there. He says that if it had been on the agenda of Bill Casey, who ran the CIA, the US foreign intelligence agency, Casey would have talked to him about it. It is told as a top official's word on whether the government's inner circle was dealing with the topic."
